  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Heya,\nFirst of all I just wanted to thank you for your continued work these\npast few days to work on community suggestions, taxing as it was for\nyou guys.\nSo I wanted to suggest that instead of there being a simple on/off\ncontent filter for the chat, there would be either a divider between\nswears and slurs, or the ability to have a custom filter, for people\nthat are ok with swears but not slurs, and so that any bypasses can be\nquickly removed\nOnce again, thank you so much for all of your help!",
